  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9f96da7d71384674ea26234b3f540b85, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  GEMINI_API_KEY: AIzaSyBqTxrdW581sen9Uh9IEvWQTrxhEcUZTC4
  GOOGLE_API_KEY: 'AIzaSyD4G7xEZUpu37H9KkmGdU4BHT8hkAMEu4o '
  prompt: The answer you give should consist of 2 short sentences. The sentences
    will consist of a kind desciption of what the user did wrong when doing shoulder
    presses according to what we will tell you and also how to fix it.
  good_prompt: The answer you give should only consist of 2 short sentence. The sentences
    will consist of compliments of how well the user seems to have performed the
    shoulder press exercise it just did and perhaps specify how they seemed to have
    good form and went all the way up and down with their arms during the exercise.
  feedback_prompts:
  - The user tends to have the left hand lower than the right when doing the exercise,
    which makes it uneven.
  - The user tends to have the right hand lower than the left when doing the exercise,
    which makes it uneven.
  - The user tends to have their arms held in a wide angle, when they should be pointing
    straight up throughout the exercise.
  - The user tends to not go all the way down with the arms when doing the exerice
    which should be done for full range of motion.
  - The user tends to not go all the way up with the arms when doing the exerice
    which should be done for full range of motion.
