  instructionButtonNext: {fileID: 5826180334329552150}
  instructionButtonPrevious: {fileID: 1502739879}
  setButton: {fileID: 2004508408}
  avatar: {fileID: 1282508575}
  instruction_list:
  - Press CONNECT on the video panel to the right. When you have pressed the button
    a VIDEO-STREAM will appear on the panel. if not, try pressing CONNECT again.
    When done; press NEXT
  - Make sure your body and the red skeleton is centered on the video panel. You
    can also move the entire video canvas by pinching it on the sides with your thumb,
    index- and middle finger. When done; press NEXT
  - You are now done with the setup. Next is using the app, which includes 2 sets
    of shoulder presses you will perform by mimicing the 3D avatar in front of you.
    When starting a set you will hear a countdown, after which the set will begin
    and last until Another countdown is done.  When done; press NEXT
  - Make sure you wait in between each set to get feedback on your form. To start
    a set you press the start button that will appear to the right after you have
    pressed DONE. When done; press DONE.
  clickDelay: 1
