  instruction_list:
  - Press connect on the video panel to the right. A white screen and in a few seconds
    a video should appear. If not, try again pressing Connect again.
  - Make sure your body and the red skeleton is in full view in the video panel.
    If not, adjust your position or the phone's placement.
  - You are now done with the setup. Next is using the app, which you do by starting
    a set with the start set button that will appear. Your task is to follow the
    movements of the 3d avatar until it stops moving or you hear the countdown.
  clickDelay: 1
